# Maintainers who review changes to each data provider. The provider
# interface, registry, and SDK come first, with the lint rule and check that
# hold the boundary. Each provider directory then names whoever maintains that
# adapter. A later line wins for the paths it matches, so keep each provider's
# line below the providers/ line.

/central/src/providers/                        @wtadler
/central/eslint.config.mjs                     @wtadler
/central/eslint-provider-boundary.mjs          @wtadler
/central/scripts/check-provider-boundary.mjs   @wtadler
/central/src/providers/legiscan/               @wtadler
/central/src/providers/lims/                   @wtadler
/central/src/providers/mga/                    @wtadler
/central/src/providers/lis/                    @wtadler
